and the watcher gets `Terminated`), `TestSup1Initialization` and `TestSup4PreStartFailuresUnderAFiniteBudget`.
S16's watchers use a message type that
is comparable with `==`, because the runtime tells a repeated `WatchWith` from a conflicting one that way and the message type
